      "statement": "The system comprises six deployable components: API server (FastAPI, port 8080, public), agent server (FastAPI/LangGraph, port 8080, ClusterIP), RAG MCP server (streamable-HTTP, port 8000, ClusterIP), ingestion worker (SQS consumer, no port), three CronJobs (record_sweeper, glacier_tagger, retention), and web app (React/Vite/nginx, port 8080, public).",
